# Ditonira — role boundaries

Read `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` §11–12 and the active inbox in `docs/HANDOFF.md` before acting.

| Role | May edit | Must never edit |
|---|---|---|
| Architect | `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, architecture docs, `docs/HANDOFF.md` decisions | `src/`, product build/packaging logic |
| Implementer | `src/`, `CMakeLists.txt`, `packaging/`, `resources/`, HANDOFF status, ENG_LOG resolutions | `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` |
| Tester | `tests/`, HANDOFF findings, `docs/ENGINEERING_LOG.md` | `src/`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` |

- Do not cross roles “just to finish faster.”
- Persist decisions in `HANDOFF.md` / `ENGINEERING_LOG.md`; chat history alone is not enough.
- **English only** for documentation (`README.md`, `docs/*`, Cursor rules, handoffs, engineering log), code comments, identifiers, **and end-user UI strings**. Never author new docs or UI copy in Spanish.
- If architecture is missing or conflicting: Implementer/Tester ask in HANDOFF → Architect decides → Implementer codes.
